      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It is a collection which store data in key-value pair .\n\nEvery key must be unique although value can be\nrepeated .\n\nMap is an interface .\n\nimplementation classes are\n---------------------------------\n\n-->HashMap  ( stores data in such a way that output\nis always random )\n\n--> TreeMap  (stores such a way that output is\nalways sorted based on key .)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is a collection which store data in key-value pair .\n\nEvery key must be unique although value can be repeated .\n\nMap is an interface .\n\nimplementation classes are\n---------------------------------\n\n-->HashMap  ( stores data in such a way that output is always random )\n\n--> TreeMap  (stores such a way that output is always sorted based on key .)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
